    "sentence_translations": [
      "Three Times Seven is Twenty-One",
      "",
      "One day, the weather was really good, but it was very windy.",
      "A person was walking on his way and suddenly wanted to smoke.",
      "He said to himself: “If I don’t succeed in lighting my cigarette after trying three times, I won’t smoke.”",
      "It turned out that he didn’t succeed.",
      "Then he said to himself: “I will light it seven more times, and if I still don’t succeed, I really won’t smoke.”",
      "It turned out that he still didn’t succeed.",
      "As a result, he said to himself again: “No matter what may happen, I will smoke when I succeed in lighting it.”"
    ]
